==Strategy==
Use the Oldhorn and The Face as platforms to launch Wave Attacks via units like [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]], [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling]], [[Hermit Cat (Special Cat)|Masked Grandmaster Cat]], etc., to kill the Assassin Bears. The Assassin Bears are also weak enough to where the regular [[Cat Cannon]] kills them, so it's advised you bring it in case they kill your Wave Attackers before they have a chance to retaliate. For extra caution, bring a Recharge Speed Up (M) or (L) [[Cat Combo]]. Once all the Assassin Bears are dealt with, dispose of The Face and Oldhorn and win.

